<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10883] IgniteRebalanceOnCachesStoppingOrDestroyingTest flaky failed in PDS4</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10883</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=-3436991258700651390&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;testStopCachesOnDeactivation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=-3436991258700651390&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;testStopCachesOnDeactivation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The&#160;first problem in a test, it is not checked that rebalance completed after test action performed. And the&#160;second problem in an assert, there are no guarantees that cache will not be destroyed before checkpoint completed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
